\* Template for the buggy variants: run.sh substitutes @BUG@.
CONSTANTS
    Experts = {e1, e2, e3}
    Slots = {s1, s2}
    HostBufs = {h1, h2}
    TopK = 2
    MaxInflight = 2
    GraphMax = 1
    None = None
    Garbage = Garbage
    Bug = "@BUG@"
SPECIFICATION Spec
SYMMETRY Symmetry
INVARIANTS TypeOK KernelReadsValid CopySourceValid TableConsistent GraphValid NoDuplicates
